# The public repository holds the site: pages, styles, scripts, pictures,
# fonts, articles and translations (dharma/), plus tools/md2html.py, which
# builds the article pages from their Markdown, and tools/stamp.py, which
# marks the start page's styles, scripts and pictures with versions.
# Everything else in this folder stays local: the rest of tools/ (glow-map
# generator, import of the Dharma translation, lettering of the leaf, the
# site icon).
# A new top-level site file must be added to the list below.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/index.html
!/favicon.ico
!/favicon.svg
!/apple-touch-icon.png
!/styles.css
!/app.js
!/glow.js
!/glowmaps.js
!/catalog.js
!/celts.json
!/dharma.json
!/pics/
!/fonts/
!/articles/
!/dharma/

# Of tools/, only the article builder and the version marks.
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/md2html.py
!/tools/stamp.py

# Editor and system leftovers inside the published folders.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
